    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Base class for internal nodes that filter messages.</para><para>Filtering is applied when properties are baked, which should happen exactly once for each message, usually just before the message is posted for the first time. </para>    </detaileddescription>
